    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't Look Behind&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game. Your goal is to pass each level and enjoy the surprises that the game brings you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average 60-90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Background</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a space that moves forward in a straight line. You must pass each difficulty and reach the final exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. You need to control your character to interact with the environment in each level until you successfully reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains elements of shock and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are strongly advised to assess whether they are suitable to play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't Look Behind&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game. Your goal is to pass each level and enjoy the surprises that the game brings you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average 60-90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Background</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a space that moves forward in a straight line. You must pass each difficulty and reach the final exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is very simple. You need to control your character to interact with the environment in each level until you successfully reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains elements of shock and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are strongly advised to assess whether they are suitable to play.</p>",
